      relais: [{"slug":"salome-klein","fr":"Salomé raconte qu'en sortant d'école elle pensait se concentrer sur l'analyse et la stratégie, et que savoir paramétrer le tracking et coder ses propres tests est devenu son plus grand levier d'autonomie.","en":"Salomé says that coming out of school she expected to focus on analysis and strategy, and that knowing how to set up tracking and code her own tests became her biggest source of autonomy."}],
